12:52.396 --> 12:53.773
"Tolong bantu aku, Kak."

12:56.233 --> 12:57.234
Tolong bantu aku.

12:58.986 --> 12:59.820
Kak.

13:21.258 --> 13:23.969
Hei, kau ngapain di sini?
Di kehidupan lampau,

13:24.053 --> 13:26.138
