21:14.231 --> 21:15.232
Oh, ya?

21:16.525 --> 21:17.776
Bangunin sepuluh menit lagi.

21:20.237 --> 21:21.071
Ah.

21:51.935 --> 21:52.936
Benar dia?

21:53.687 --> 21:57.399
